# Store and check out text as LF on every platform: hashed inputs (receipts,
# pre-registered rules, provenance) must be byte-identical on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.rvt binary
*.rfa binary
*.ies text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
